# Offline oracle note — dfpt-gga-si (PW DFPT PBE GGA kernel, diamond Si)

## Intent

Pin Γ-point DFPT phonons for diamond Si with **true PBE GGA** XC kernel on
the plane-wave method, twinning the LSDA product path (`dfpt-phonon-si`).

## Preferred oracle

CP2K Quickstep DFPT / `VIBRATIONAL_ANALYSIS` (or Quantum ESPRESSO `ph.x`)
on the same cell with a comparable NC/GTH setup and PBE.

## Host status (2026-07-26)

No CP2K / QE module or binary on the pin host (`module avail cp2k` empty).
Sharp correctness pin is therefore the **same-Hamiltonian central second
difference of the PW SCF total energy** (h = 0.03 Å) at identical
ecut/k/XC/UPF — recorded in
`regressions/response/dfpt-gga-si/REFERENCE.md`.

## Twin settings (match regression)

| Item | Value |
| ---- | ----- |
| Cell | diamond Si, a = 5.43 Å, 2-atom fcc primitive |
| PP | `tests/data/pw/Si_lda_nc.upf` (in-tree NC ONCV) |
| XC | PBE (true GGA) |
| ecut | 10 Ry |
| k-mesh | 2×2×2 MP |

When CP2K becomes available: record ω(Γ) [cm⁻¹], version, and wall for
fair ratio \(T_{\mathrm{atv}}/T_{\mathrm{cp2k}}\).
